2026-10-14  O8+ + H (Harel, Jouin & Pons 1998): o8+h_sec_qmocc.cs renamed o8+h_sec_mocc.cs, Method=QMOCC -> MOCC
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Harel, Jouin & Pons (ADNDT 68, 279, 1998) is a semiclassical MOCC calculation (OEDM basis), as for N7+ + H (corrected
2026-10-13); the file name and header line 4 said QMOCC. Data unchanged. Original in Working/Theory/AdaptToKronos/o8h_qmocc_before_mocc_rename_20261014-004418.tgz.
Files: CXDatabase/Projectile_Ions/O/Charge/8/Targets/H/o8+h_sec_qmocc.cs (removed) -> o8+h_sec_mocc.cs

