2026-10-13  Kronos v3.4 (working): MCLZ cross sections replaced (283 systems)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
MCLZ files chosen in the v3.4 review (Working/Theory/Kronos_v3_review: kronos_v3.3_selection.pdf/.csv, user decisions). Rule: the
v3.3 file is kept when it agrees with our new MCLZ run (ICR structure: AUTOS ICR levels, NIST-corrected + quantum defect + plateau,
Wigner-Witmer channels) within 15 % over 1-1e4 eV/u, else the cxdatabase GitHub/Published version if it agrees, else the new run;
user decisions override. Bare ions: the 2014-2016 MCLZ files had an error in the rotational coupling (alpha1 formula in the C
lzmcro; corrected 2026-08); replacements are P. C. Stancil's recalculations (Fortran code, unaffected) or new runs. H-like
projectiles (He-like products): improved level energies. Old v3.3 MCLZ files removed (archive
Kronos_v3_review/kronos_v3_before_v34_selection_20261013-123139.tgz); each changed folder's .nist.in is now the level list of the
kept calculation. Bare-ion files are n-resolved, named *_sec_mclz_nres.cs (one MCLZ file per folder, as Kronos v3 requires).
Held (unchanged, decision pending): Ne10+ + H, He; Li3+ + H MCLZ; Mg9+ + H; Mg10+ + H.
  From the cxdatabase GitHub copy (153): Li3+ CO/CO2/H2/H2O/HE/N2; Be4+ CO/CO2/H/H2/H2O/HE/N2; B5+ CO/CO2/H/H2/H2O/HE/N2; N6+
